     "name": "externalProjectAssignGuardChain",
     "file": "webApps/vbredwoodapp/flows/customer-portal/pages/customer-billing-detail-page-chains/externalProjectAssignGuardChain.js",
     "about": "Withdraws the customer billing screen when EXTERNAL_PROJECT_ASSIGN_ENABLED is ON. WHY ON, not off: with that flag on, an external request is attributed to an internal project and costed through it (see the flag's rationale in configurations-page.html and request-detail-page's Assign Project drawer). Billing then belongs to the project, so the customer-facing \"My Billing\" screen no longer describes how the request is billed and is withdrawn rather than shown with figures that do not apply. This is an INVERSE gate, which is why it calls isFeatureFlagOff() and not !isFeatureEnabled().…",
